# Taiwan Market Hints (TW)

- TW feed soft-dedupe (display only, all rows kept; `KR_FEED_SOFT_DEDUPE`,
  default on): TWSE/TPEx material filings pair same-source only (ticker +
  Taipei day + normalized title) — the two boards are never annotated against
  each other by title. `yahoo_tw` / `google_news_tw` news pairs across sources
  on ticker + Taipei day + normalized title.
- 興櫃 (Emerging) is not wired: no stable free feed.
- TWSE/TPEx material feeds are key-free, not a paid MOPS push.
- Finnhub is US only and never queried for TW.
